<title>USA: Florida Panthers to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Florida Panthers to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida Panthers Holdings Inc said on Tuesday that it would begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;PAW&quot; on July 11.</p>
<p>The company, which owns such properties as the Florida Panthers Hockey Club and the Boca Raton Resort &amp; Club, will continue to trade temporarily on the National Association of Securities Dealers Automated Quotation system under the symbol &quot;PUCK.&quot;</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
